# Hinterlands (Horde) - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in the
# Hinterlands for a Horde buyer, verified against the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Eight ship
# as buys from in-zone vendors (George, Zan, Ruppo, Gigget and Smudge,
# plus the Revantusk pair Otho and Qujo for the sagefish recipes); seven
# ship as drops with narrow in-zone droppers (the Wildvine recipe rides
# a collect on each narrow step that drops it). Recipes sold only by
# Wildhammer (Alliance) vendors do not ship here (Nightscape Shoulders,
# Mithril Scale Bracers, Tender Wolf Steak - each names its off-zone
# Horde vendor instead). Everything else Hinterlands-dropping is a
# generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the
# inventory). Quest records carry no reward data, so no quest-reward
# recipe ships (see docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught
# staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover those.
# Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. Fishing and First Aid have no Hinterlands Horde source, so
# that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/hinterlands-horde-recipes
title Hinterlands (Horde) - Recipes
levels 38-46
zone The Hinterlands
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords hinterlands, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Bitter Gate - green leather armor (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 2698 -- George Candarte (7.9, 73.3)
  buy 7613 "Pattern: Green Leather Armor" npc 2698
  note George Candarte (Horde) sells the pattern in-zone; Wenna Silkbeard stocks it for the Alliance in the Wetlands. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Razorfen Downs - cloaking device (Engineering)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Engineering 1

  vendor 6777 -- Zan Shivsproket (1.3, 56.9)
  buy 7742 "Schematic: Gnomish Cloaking Device" npc 6777
  note Zan Shivsproket (neutral) is the sole vendor anywhere in the data. Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

