step Revantusk Village - sagefish (Cooking)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 14738 -- Otho Moji'ko (79.38, 79.08)
  vendor 270780 -- Qujo (77.95, 77.83)
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish" npc 14738
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight" npc 14738
  note Both are 24-vendor generic cooking stock; the Horde round buys at Revantusk (Otho Moji'ko, Horde - Qujo by the guard post stocks them too). Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Vilebranch terraces - ironfeather breastplate (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1425

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  loop
  goto 57.61,66.63
  goto 59.16,66.11
