  goto 65.02,77.08
  goto 65.39,75.61
  goto 66.03,74.53
  goto 66.84,80.31
  goto 67.48,76.24
  goto 68.31,75.28
  kill 2644 optional
  collect 15760 "Pattern: Ironfeather Breastplate" optional
  collect 9294 "Recipe: Wildvine Potion" optional
  note The Vilebranch Hideskinner is the sole dropper anywhere in the data for the Breastplate and spawns only in the Hinterlands; he shares the terraces with the Wildvine recipe stock (narrow 3-zone drop, not a dozens-of-zones world drop). No quest takes the pattern.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

